1
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,820
Hmm, where's Kazuto?

2
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,937
He should have shown up by now.

3
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:18,797
Maybe they don't have all the
battles up on the feet yet.

4
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:20,360
I mean, knowing Kirito,

5
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,097
we should have seen him running
around guns blazing from the start.

6
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,340
I don't know.

7
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:27,057
He's one of the craftiest
players I've ever met.

8
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,897
He's probably laying low somewhere waiting

9
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,509
for the competition to
kill each other off.

10
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,150
Oh, please.

11
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,497
You and I both know he
doesn't play like that.

12
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,874
Isn't that right, Yui?

13
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:37,990
Absolutely.

14
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:41,377
Besides that, he's so fast, I
doubt he'll even show up on camera.

15
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:44,957
He'll sneak up and strike before
his enemy knows what's happening.

16
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:46,900
He can't do it any other way.

17
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:49,657
I mean, it's a game with
guns and he's using a sword.

18
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:50,799
What a dupe thing.

19
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,320
He's kind of a dork.

20
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:57,680
That one guy's unbelievable.

21
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:01,260
You mean the one in white?

22
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,960
Oh, he's super fast.

23
00:01:30,540 --> 00:01:32,100
Yeah, that guy's sick.

24
00:01:32,340 --> 00:01:34,399
I bet he's going to win this thing.

25
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:38,693
Looks like your boy's full of suck, Liz.

26
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:40,840
Shut up, he's not out of it yet.

27
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,740
What happened to him?

28
00:01:48,660 --> 00:01:50,537
It's some kind of paralysis attack.

29
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:52,120
Most likely temporary.

30
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:57,120
It's like he was hit with
that wind spell, Thunderweb.

31
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,030
Uh...

32
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:22,320
Malawatsuri ma.

33
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:27,397
Muzun Dark no Sugou wo.

34
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:32,140
So no te de uchi harate.

35
00:02:38,260 --> 00:02:43,040
Ikonleta namiida no nukumori de.

36
00:03:14,180 --> 00:03:32,597
I'm not going to die.

37
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:15,620
Xenon, shoot. Huh? Which one?

38
00:04:15,880 --> 00:04:17,317
It's the guy in the cloak.

39
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,341
There's no time.

40
00:04:18,460 --> 00:04:19,480
Shoot him. Hurry.

41
00:04:19,740 --> 00:04:21,387
Don't let him fire that gun.

42
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,070
Oh.

43
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:34,940
Oh, crap.

44
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,660
He knew I was here.

45
00:04:37,580 --> 00:04:38,560
How could he?

46
00:04:38,960 --> 00:04:40,640
Maybe he spotted me earlier.

47
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:42,959
Got my position from the last scan.

48
00:05:28,420 --> 00:05:30,120
Jesus, what was that?

49
00:05:44,060 --> 00:05:49,220
Death Gun is my name,
and the name of my gun.

50
00:05:52,300 --> 00:05:53,680
One day,

51
00:05:54,100 --> 00:05:57,060
I'll pay you all a visit too,

52
00:05:57,460 --> 00:06:01,497
and bring real death with this gun.

53
00:06:01,580 --> 00:06:08,357
You've seen my power it
is real this isn't over

54
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:12,057
not yet I'm just getting

55
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:16,700
Started it's showtime

56
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:27,320
I've met that person before but where
there's only one place I could have

57
00:06:28,300 --> 00:06:29,200
I'm Grad.

58
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:33,935
Way to scare the hell out of everyone.

59
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:38,740
You gotta be kidding me. No way. Can't be.

60
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,320
You know him too?

61
00:06:40,580 --> 00:06:42,051
Do you remember his name?

62
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:43,190
No.

63
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:46,340
I forget the handle he used, but it's him.

64
00:06:47,460 --> 00:06:48,620
There's no doubt.

65
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:50,840
He was in Laughing Coffin.

66
00:06:53,380 --> 00:06:54,620
Laughing Coffin.

67
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:56,760
Was he their leader?

68
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,967
You know, the knife-wielder?

69
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:01,680
No, I'm pretty sure it's not Pooh.

70
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:05,708
Something about the way this
guy talks and acts is different.

71
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:08,675
Except for that show timeline, though.

72
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,598
Pooh was the only one who said that.

73
00:07:12,020 --> 00:07:14,460
But this guy, he was close to Pooh.

74
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,501
I'm talking right-hand man close.

75
00:07:18,180 --> 00:07:19,010
Kirito.

76
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:25,060
It's him, all right.

77
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:28,540
Oh, yeah. That's Death Gun. Death Gun?

78
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:29,840
You're joking.

79
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:33,497
You mean those rumors about players
getting shot and disappearing,

80
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:34,657
those are all true?

81
00:07:34,740 --> 00:07:35,660
Yeah, they are.

82
00:07:35,940 --> 00:07:40,457
I don't know how he does it yet, but he's
been killing players in the real world.

83
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:42,440
That's insane. It's not.

84
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:45,018
Two people have been confirmed dead.

85
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:00,560
Where'd he go?

86
00:08:07,500 --> 00:08:09,437
Kirito, watch the bridge for a sec.

87
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:12,157
I'm gonna check the scan and
see what name he's going by.

88
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,240
Yeah, you got it.

89
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,390
Huh?

90
00:08:29,473 --> 00:08:30,303
Where is he?

91
00:08:30,386 --> 00:08:31,825
Could he have moved that fast?

92
00:08:34,260 --> 00:08:35,090
No.

93
00:08:35,173 --> 00:08:36,003
This is our chance.

94
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:37,630
For what?

95
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:40,517
Your pal in the cloak isn't
showing up on the terminal.

96
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,659
My guess is he jumped in the river.

97
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:46,251
If I'm right, then he had to
disable his gear like you did.

98
00:08:46,660 --> 00:08:48,013
What about his handgun?

99
00:08:48,140 --> 00:08:50,897
He can still move underwater
with that equipped, right?

100
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:53,297
Even if he could, it's
just one little handgun.

101
00:08:53,380 --> 00:08:54,777
I could take him out easy with my head.

102
00:08:54,860 --> 00:08:55,690
You can't!

103
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,814
You saw what happened.

104
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:00,629
He used that little
gun to kill Pale Rider.

105
00:09:01,180 --> 00:09:03,560
All it takes is one shot. Get it?

106
00:09:03,700 --> 00:09:05,700
One shot and you're dead for real!

107
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:10,280
Yeah, well, I'm not buying it.

108
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,220
How's it even possible?

109
00:09:12,980 --> 00:09:15,420
I mean, a player killing people IRL?

110
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:19,640
I know it sounds crazy,
but it's the truth.

111
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:24,240
This Death Gun guy killed a lot
of people in that VR MMO I was in.

112
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:28,980
When he used his sword on someone,
he knew he was really killing him.

113
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:32,230
And...

114
00:09:32,313 --> 00:09:33,180
so did I.

115
00:09:36,620 --> 00:09:38,057
There's a killer...

116
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:39,497
a murderer...

117
00:09:39,580 --> 00:09:40,660
in GGO.

118
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:55,100
Xenon! Xenon!

119
00:09:59,040 --> 00:09:59,870
I'm alright.

120
00:10:00,340 --> 00:10:01,869
Just a little freaked out.

121
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:06,228
Anyway, I'm still not convinced
what you told me is possible.

122
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:09,477
But, I don't think you're
lying to me about it either.

123
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:10,577
That's good enough.

124
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:15,980
I can't ask for more yeah well we
better get out of the area asap.

125
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:19,777
The others know we're here
by now they think we're

126
00:10:19,860 --> 00:10:22,437
busy fighting each other so
they'll be closing in soon.

127
00:10:22,520 --> 00:10:27,297
you got a point we'll split
up here then wait what are

128
00:10:27,380 --> 00:10:31,597
you gonna do i'm going after
death gun alone whatever

129
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:35,957
you do stay away from him
i'll keep my promise next

130
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:38,257
time we see each other i'll
give you the fight i owe you.

131
00:10:38,340 --> 00:10:41,237
oh and one more thing
thanks for hearing me out.

132
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:42,237
just now instead of

133
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,150
shooting me

134
00:10:43,233 --> 00:10:46,617
huh hey

135
00:10:46,700 --> 00:10:53,177
wait for

136
00:10:53,260 --> 00:11:00,097
me i'm coming with you
what that death gun guy

137
00:11:00,180 --> 00:11:03,437
seems pretty tough and
if he kills you you won't

138
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:05,797
be able to fight me i
don't think you get out.

139
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,677
I'm not a fan of teaming up either,

140
00:11:07,760 --> 00:11:09,597
but I think we stand a
better chance of knocking

141
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:12,327
that guy out of the game
if we work together.

142
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,500
No, I'm not down with that.

143
00:11:14,660 --> 00:11:15,757
It's too dangerous.

144
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,537
We don't have any idea
where he'll pop up next,

145
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:21,679
so it'll be dangerous whether
we're together or not.

146
00:11:44,680 --> 00:11:46,697
We better take care of this, Joker.

147
00:11:46,780 --> 00:11:49,604
I'll block his bullets,
you wait for an opening.

148
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,150
Roger that.

149
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:08,040
It's all yours!

150
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,160
No way!

151
00:12:36,260 --> 00:12:38,997
Death Gun's probably
heading north of the river.

152
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:43,077
I want to be there when he surfaces,
but I don't know where he'll stop.

153
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:44,480
Got any ideas, Sinon?

154
00:12:46,220 --> 00:12:47,050
Uh...

155
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:50,637
I don't know if he's got
any other special skills,

156
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:53,014
but from what I've seen, he's a sniper.

157
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:56,885
He's going to avoid open spaces
and look for a place with cover.

158
00:12:57,600 --> 00:13:01,071
If I were him, I'd set myself
up in the ruins of that city.

159
00:13:01,860 --> 00:13:02,690
Good.

160
00:13:02,773 --> 00:13:05,127
Then that's where you
and me are going to go.

161
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,440
I'm your six.

162
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:25,560
In SAO, we had a code.

163
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:29,980
Never let another player's
HP hit zero, no matter what.

164
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:34,260
We knew if it dropped to
nothing, that player would die.

165
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:39,960
Laughing Coffin didn't care.

166
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:43,317
They killed dozens,
no, hundreds of people.

167
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:45,217
The assault team had to step in.

168
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:49,060
They put a party together to
hunt them down, and capture them.

169
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:52,860
And Kazuto was there with you?

170
00:13:54,180 --> 00:13:55,010
Yeah.

171
00:13:55,093 --> 00:13:56,697
He was up front, going toe-to-toe.

172
00:13:56,780 --> 00:13:58,898
Everything went to hell pretty fast.

173
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:03,140
Oh man, that's why Kazuto's
been acting so weird lately.

174
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,177
Now I'm worried.

175
00:14:05,260 --> 00:14:08,378
Maybe he's trying to settle
some grudge or something.

176
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:09,350
Grudge?

177
00:14:09,433 --> 00:14:11,471
Isn't this supposed to be a part-time job?

178
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:15,220
Sorry, I'm logging out for a bit. Why?

179
00:14:15,580 --> 00:14:18,017
I have to get in touch
with Kirito's client.

180
00:14:18,100 --> 00:14:19,512
Wait, he's got a client?

181
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:23,047
He's the one who got
Kirito to dive into GGO.

182
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,224
I bet he knows what's going on.

183
00:14:26,100 --> 00:14:26,930
Oh, and Yui?

184
00:14:27,013 --> 00:14:28,797
I'm going to need your
help while I'm gone.

185
00:14:28,880 --> 00:14:31,360
Find out anything you can about GGO.

186
00:14:31,700 --> 00:14:33,380
You can count on me, Mommy!

187
00:14:34,180 --> 00:14:35,837
I'll be back in a little while.

188
00:14:35,920 --> 00:14:36,750
Wish me luck.

189
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:56,760
Where the heck did he go?

190
00:14:57,860 --> 00:15:00,457
You think we might have passed
him on the way over here?

191
00:15:00,540 --> 00:15:01,940
No, we didn't pass him.

192
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:06,044
I was keeping an eye on the river
the whole time we were running.

193
00:15:07,220 --> 00:15:08,050
Oh.

194
00:15:08,133 --> 00:15:09,237
Well, the river dead ends here.

195
00:15:09,320 --> 00:15:12,849
I guess he must be lurking
around somewhere in the city now.

196
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,160
Okay. Listen,

197
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:17,969
when his location pops
up in the next scan,

198
00:15:18,100 --> 00:15:20,806
we'll rush him before
he can kill anyone else.

199
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,540
I'm done with that.

200
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:24,317
But there's one problem.

201
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:26,297
How will we know who Death Gun is?

202
00:15:26,380 --> 00:15:29,320
I mean, that's not his
avatar's handle, remember?

203
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,540
Oh, yeah, right.

204
00:15:32,540 --> 00:15:34,599
Then let's start with what we know.

205
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:37,857
You said you didn't recognize
the names of three new players.

206
00:15:37,940 --> 00:15:40,340
It's not Pale Rider, that's for sure.

207
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:46,461
That leaves us with two names in play that
could be Death Gun, Jushi X, and Sterben.

208
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:50,920
If they're both in this city, we
can't afford to pick the wrong one.

209
00:15:52,100 --> 00:15:53,020
Wait a sec.

210
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,637
I just thought of something.

211
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:59,120
In Japanese, the Shi in
Jushi means death, get it?

212
00:15:59,340 --> 00:16:03,800
And the X could mean cross, like making
the sign of the cross, you think?

213
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:05,580
Or maybe it's too obvious.

214
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:07,880
Maybe not.

215
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:11,205
Aren't Avatar names
usually simple and obvious?

216
00:16:11,500 --> 00:16:14,460
Mine's a variation on
my real name. And yours?

217
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,380
Yeah, same here.

218
00:16:20,300 --> 00:16:24,260
Well, if they're both here,
we'll go after Jushi X first.

219
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:28,060
Oh, and if I get paralyzed
like Pale Rider, don't panic.

220
00:16:28,380 --> 00:16:29,968
Get into position and wait.

221
00:16:30,140 --> 00:16:30,970
Huh?

222
00:16:31,053 --> 00:16:33,137
Deathgun's probably
hiding somewhere close.

223
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:36,867
When he comes out to finish me
off, that's when you shoot him.

224
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:40,054
Aren't you worried I'll shoot you, too?

225
00:16:40,180 --> 00:16:41,121
Are you kidding?

226
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:44,575
You're the last person I'd
expect to play it like that.

227
00:16:44,660 --> 00:16:45,719
Let's go, partner.

228
00:16:46,060 --> 00:16:47,240
I'm counting on you.

229
00:16:57,560 --> 00:17:00,148
Okay, but once we get
him, all bets are off!

230
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:15,113
Kirito, check the north side of the map.

231
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:23,690
It's him.

232
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,357
He's the only one in the city.

233
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,857
I guess he's our man, huh?

234
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:29,881
Yeah, I don't see Sterben around.

235
00:17:30,060 --> 00:17:30,890
That settles it.

236
00:17:30,973 --> 00:17:33,177
Jushi-X and Death Gun are one in the same.

237
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:35,025
That means he's going after...

238
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:35,990
...him.

239
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:38,400
We better move fast.

240
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:40,720
Rikoko's almost in range. Yeah.

241
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:42,257
Are you ready for this?

242
00:17:42,340 --> 00:17:43,170
Yep.

243
00:18:11,660 --> 00:18:13,120
Found him. Up there.

244
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:17,497
He's probably waiting for Rikoko
to walk right up into his sights.

245
00:18:17,580 --> 00:18:20,717
I'll attack Jushi-X from
behind while I got the chance.

246
00:18:20,800 --> 00:18:22,577
That building in front
of the stadium might

247
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:24,637
be a good place for you
to get into position.

248
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:26,880
No, I'm coming with you.

249
00:18:27,320 --> 00:18:28,280
Not this time.

250
00:18:28,560 --> 00:18:31,325
I can fight way better
knowing you got my back.

251
00:18:31,520 --> 00:18:32,873
We're a team, remember?

252
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,270
Mm-hmm.

253
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:41,677
All I'm gonna need is 30 seconds to get up
there and I'll be ready to take him out.

254
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:43,407
Is that enough time for you?

255
00:18:43,700 --> 00:18:45,080
Mm-hmm. Plenty.

256
00:18:45,620 --> 00:18:47,180
Cool. See you in a bit.

257
00:19:05,120 --> 00:19:08,640
As soon as Death Gun's gone,
we'll be enemies again.

258
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:14,640
I'll shoot him, beat
him, and then forget him.

259
00:19:16,020 --> 00:19:16,850
Whatever.

260
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:20,002
It's not like I'll ever
see him again after this.

261
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:41,060
But Death Gun's supposed
to be in the stadium.

262
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:09,670
Kirito,

263
00:20:10,100 --> 00:20:16,560
wherever you are, it's time I found out
if you were the real deal or a fake.

264
00:20:18,120 --> 00:20:24,120
I remember how you fought
back then, all fury and rage.

265
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:30,160
If I kill this friend of yours,
and you go berserk like I remember,

266
00:20:30,580 --> 00:20:32,440
I'll know it's really you.

267
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:36,060
He's gotta kill me?

268
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:41,460
Come on, Kirito.

269
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:42,840
Show me.

270
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:48,940
Let's see your fury, your
rage, your insane sword.

271
00:20:50,020 --> 00:20:52,840
Show me for old time's sake.

272
00:21:08,300 --> 00:21:11,400
My Type 54, Black Star.

273
00:21:20,740 --> 00:21:21,980
It's the gun.

274
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:24,750
Why?

275
00:21:25,700 --> 00:21:26,800
Why here?

276
00:21:27,140 --> 00:21:29,180
Why does he have that gun?

277
00:21:51,980 --> 00:21:52,810
Mijn...

278
00:21:53,980 --> 00:21:54,917
... Mijn...

279
00:21:55,000 --> 00:22:02,620
...

280
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:07,920
I want to be strong,

281
00:22:08,380 --> 00:22:13,720
strong, strong, I want to
be proud of the sadness.

282
00:22:17,080 --> 00:22:22,520
I've never been to the past.

283
00:22:45,500 --> 00:22:50,860
I don't need one thing anymore.

284
00:22:53,520 --> 00:22:57,380
I want to be strong and strong.

285
00:22:58,580 --> 00:23:00,877
I want to be strong and strong.

286
00:23:00,960 --> 00:23:02,240
I want to be a dream.

287
00:23:02,900 --> 00:23:08,500
I want to be a dream like a dream.

288
00:23:35,660 --> 00:23:38,417
Next time, Death Chaser.

289
00:23:38,500 --> 00:23:41,940
Here we go.
